      "content": "that's a good start. but honestly, i'm worried about that last bit where you mention the 'unseen cost'. the theme of this specific wing is really about the triumph of the human spirit and the building of a nation. adding stuff about the 'cost' might actually distract from the main message of progress and make the tone feel heavy or even apologetic. can we just focus on the greatness of the expansion and leave the controversial stuff for a different section?",
